    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something  is putting the frogs of Ribbit Island in danger, and it is up to you to save them! Traverse the island to find and slay &quot;The Lost Legend&quot;! What is that anyway?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield the Red Seraphine Lily on your head and get ready to fight &quot;The Lost Legend&quot; in this short RPG with only ONE battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth of the frogs' past and explore the world of NO HAPPY DAYS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Only one fight! ... &quot;The Lost Legend&quot;! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Friendly frogs ready to make you smile! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Art and Original Music full of life and personality </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A... secret?? Wait... who did that &quot;frog&quot; see in the maze?  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > . . . </p></li></ul>",
